Data, scripts, and outputs for the Bayesian VBGF models.
To run the Bayesian VBGF models, open the script titled "lknowNew.R" under the folders "Analysis/R". The datafile needed to run this code is called "Scamp.csv" and is located under the folders "Data/CSV".
The other two folders are supplemental and do as follows:
Comparing growth curves to SEDAR68 = generates visualizations where Bayesian VBGF models are plotted with SEDAR68 growth curves
Comparing models' posterior distributions = generates visualizations to compare the Bayesian models' parameter-specific posterior distributions
